      "en": "And I'm Erica.",
      "zh": "我叫 Erica。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 6.65,
      "end": 9.65,
      "en": "Today we're bringing you part two of another great lesson that we had.",
      "zh": "今天，我们将为你带来之前一个精彩课程的第二部分。"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 10.13,
      "end": 11.75,
      "en": "Yes, new guy in town.",
      "zh": "是的，镇上的新人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 11.87,
      "end": 12.81,
      "en": "The new guy in town.",
      "zh": "镇上的新人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 13.12,
      "end": 13.37,
      "en": "Part two.",
      "zh": "第二部分。"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 14.12,
      "end": 15.12,
      "en": "Part two.",
      "zh": "第二部分。"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 15.12,
      "end": 15.45,
      "en": "Kind of a creepy story.",
      "zh": "有点令人毛骨悚然的故事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 16.12,
      "end": 17.12,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 17.12,
      "end": 19.73,
      "en": "Yeah, and this one is also a little bit strange, a little bit weird.",
      "zh": "对，这一集也有点奇怪，有点诡异。"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 20.13,
      "end": 22.89,
      "en": "Yeah, unusual outcome, unusual ending.",
      "zh": "是的，不寻常的结果，不寻常的结局。"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 23.77,
      "end": 25.67,
      "en": "But it has to do a lot with invitations.",
      "zh": "不过它和邀请有很大关系。"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 26.13,
      "end": 26.47,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 26.83,
      "end": 30.87,
      "en": "An invitation is when you ask somebody to do something with you.",
      "zh": "邀请是当您要求某人与您一起做某事时。"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 31.11,
      "end": 31.23,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 31.87,
      "end": 32.57,
      "en": "A dinner invitation.",
      "zh": "晚宴邀请。"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 33.41,
      "end": 37.15,
      "en": "So we're going to be talking about invitations and inviting people to do things.",
      "zh": "所以我们将谈论邀请和邀请人们做事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 37.69,
      "end": 37.95,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 38.37,
      "end": 41.75,
      "en": "Well, with that, let's listen to the dialogue for the first time.",
      "zh": "好吧，有了这个，让我们第一次听对话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 46.6,
      "end": 49.82,
      "en": "Oh, Arman, thank you for such a thoughtful invitation.",
      "zh": "哦，阿尔芒，谢谢你这么周到的邀请。"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 50.76,
      "end": 53.62,
      "en": "It's really very nice of you to invite us over for dinner.",
      "zh": "你邀请我们过来吃饭真是太好了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 54.18,
      "end": 55.18,
      "en": "Don't you think so, Ellen?",
      "zh": "你说是不是，艾伦？"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 55.86,
      "end": 57.2,
      "en": "Oh, yes, of course.",
      "zh": "哦，是的，当然。"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 57.72,
      "end": 58.56,
      "en": "We'd love to come over.",
      "zh": "我们很乐意过去。"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 59.14,
      "end": 59.9,
      "en": "Can I bring anything?",
      "zh": "我需要带什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 60.26,
      "end": 62.14,
      "en": "No, don't worry about it.",
      "zh": "不，不要担心。"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 62.8,
      "end": 63.98,
      "en": "I'll take care of everything.",
      "zh": "一切交给我处理。"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 66.41,
      "end": 67.3,
      "en": "I'll see you tonight.",
      "zh": "今晚见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 67.41,
      "end": 68.74,
      "en": "Come with an appetite.",
      "zh": "可要带着胃口来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 69.21,
      "end": 70.02,
      "en": "I know I will.",
      "zh": "我肯定会胃口大开的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 75.4,
      "end": 77.4,
      "en": "I don't want to go over to his place for dinner.",
      "zh": "我不想去他家吃饭。"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 77.88,
      "end": 78.84,
      "en": "He gives me the creeps.",
      "zh": "他让我浑身发毛。"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 79.64,
      "end": 80.78,
      "en": "Why on earth did you accept?",
      "zh": "你到底为什么答应他？"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 81.4,
      "end": 82.3,
      "en": "Oh, come on, Ellen.",
      "zh": "哎呀，拜托，艾伦。"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 82.67,
      "end": 83.99,
      "en": "It'll be nice to get to know him.",
      "zh": "认识认识他也挺好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 84.09,
      "end": 85.95,
      "en": "Besides, he's new to the neighborhood.",
      "zh": "再说，他刚搬来这个街区。"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 86.6,
      "end": 88.69,
      "en": "And it would be rude to decline his invitation.",
      "zh": "拒绝他的邀请是不礼貌的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 89.57,
      "end": 90.41,
      "en": "I guess so.",
      "zh": "我想是吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 91.19,
      "end": 92.63,
      "en": "You always rope me into things like this.",
      "zh": "你总是把我拉进这种事里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 106.15,
      "end": 106.63,
      "en": "Ladies!",
      "zh": "女士们!"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 111.11,
      "end": 112.51,
      "en": "Thank you for coming.",
      "zh": "谢谢你们能来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 112.89,
      "end": 113.65,
      "en": "You look delicious.",
