      "en": "How did I get myself into this?",
      "zh": "我怎么会把自己卷进这种事里？"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 138.67,
      "end": 142.31,
      "en": "Wow, I'm really anxious to see what happens in this dinner party.",
      "zh": "哇，我真的很想看看这个晚宴会发生什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 142.53,
      "end": 145.67,
      "en": "Yeah, I guess we'll have to stay tuned and find out.",
      "zh": "是的，我想我们必须继续关注并找出答案。"
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
