      "zh": "对于第三部分。"
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "start": 147.04,
      "end": 148.04,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "start": 148.04,
      "end": 152.85,
      "en": "All right, well, we have some really great vocabulary, so I guess we can start with language takeaway.",
