    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "start": 160.76,
      "end": 163.4,
      "en": "Erika, why don't you start us off with the first one?",
      "zh": "Erika，你为什么不从第一个开始呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "start": 163.4,
      "end": 165.0,
      "en": "The first word is thoughtful.",
      "zh": "第一个词是 thoughtful。"
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "start": 165.92,
      "end": 166.26,
      "en": "Thoughtful.",
      "zh": "体贴的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "start": 166.58,
      "end": 167.04,
      "en": "Thoughtful.",
      "zh": "体贴的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "start": 167.92,
      "end": 168.4,
      "en": "Thoughtful.",
      "zh": "体贴的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "start": 168.68,
      "end": 171.88,
      "en": "So, when you're thoughtful, you're kind, right?",
      "zh": "所以，当你很体贴的时候，你就很友善，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "start": 171.88,
      "end": 174.64,
      "en": "You're kind, you're considerate to other people.",
      "zh": "你很善良，你对别人很体贴。"
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "start": 174.64,
      "end": 176.62,
      "en": "You think about what the other person would like.",
      "zh": "你想想对方会喜欢什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "start": 176.96,
      "end": 177.16,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "start": 177.88,
      "end": 178.88,
      "en": "And you do that thing.",
      "zh": "而你做那件事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "start": 178.88,
      "end": 179.42,
      "en": "It's so thoughtful of you.",
      "zh": "你太周到了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "start": 179.88,
      "end": 180.88,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
