      "start": 635.98,
      "end": 644.06,
      "en": "Marco and I will choose the best continuation of the story and we'll use that in part three of The New Guy in Town.",
      "zh": "马可和我会选出最精彩的故事续篇，用在《镇上新来的家伙》第三部分里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 644.46,
      "end": 644.88,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 645.34,
      "end": 647.64,
      "en": "So you can give it any direction you want.",
      "zh": "所以你可以给它任何你想要的方向。"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 647.88,
      "end": 648.14,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 648.71,
      "end": 652.83,
      "en": "And of course, we'll publish the name of the author with the lesson.",
      "zh": "当然，我们将在课程中发布作者的姓名。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 653.4,
      "end": 654.4,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 654.4,
      "end": 658.79,
      "en": "I'm really anxious to see what ideas come up and how we can end this dialogue.",
      "zh": "我真的很想看看会出现什么想法，以及我们如何给这段对话收尾。"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 659.09,
      "end": 659.29,
      "en": "I know.",
      "zh": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 659.43,
      "end": 661.55,
      "en": "We've got a lot of really creative users out there.",
      "zh": "我们有很多非常有创意的用户。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 661.55,
      "end": 663.57,
      "en": "So I'm really looking forward to this.",
      "zh": "所以我真的很期待这个。"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 664.12,
      "end": 665.12,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 665.12,
      "end": 666.12,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 666.12,
      "end": 671.21,
      "en": "So be sure to send us your ideas, either a private message or you can post it on the comment section of this lesson.",
      "zh": "所以一定要把你的想法发给我们，可以发私信，也可以写在本课的评论区。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 672.0,
      "end": 676.14,
      "en": "And any other questions or doubts, go to EnglishPod.com and you can leave them there.",
      "zh": "以及任何其他问题或疑问，请访问 englishpod.com，您可以将它们留在那里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 676.44,
      "end": 677.44,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 677.44,
      "end": 678.82,
      "en": "Marco and I are always happy to answer your questions.",
      "zh": "马可和我总是很乐意回答您的问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 679.32,
      "end": 680.06,
      "en": "Okay, folks.",
      "zh": "好吧，伙计们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 680.32,
      "end": 681.56,
      "en": "So until then, it's goodbye.",
      "zh": "所以在那之前，这是再见。"
    }
